<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian meat exports mixed in April 97 - ABS.</title>
<headline>Australian meat exports mixed in April 97 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for April 1997 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> April    97   2,875	87	     8,269	5,333</p>
<p> March    97   4,055	54	     8,248	4,643</p>
<p> April    96   4,174	89	     6,408	3,599</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> April    97   68,636     328	    3,546	 774</p>
<p> March    97   62,387     248	    4,252	 734</p>
<p> April    96   57,190     363	    5,444	 774</p>
<p>NOTE: Previous month's figures have been revised.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
